      "id": "github:143291989",
      "name": "Uyuni",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "Uyuni 是开源的配置与基础设施管理平台（SUSE Multi-Linux Manager 的上游社区项目），用于集中注册、打补丁、置备、配置与审计 Linux 服务器资产。",
      "homepage": "https://www.uyuni-project.org/",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni",
      "github_repository_id": 143291989,
      "license": "GPL-2.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/uyuni-project/uyuni/license",
      "features": [
        "Automated patch and package management through assignable software channels and repositories",
        "Onboarding and management of networked Linux servers, from edge devices to Kubernetes hosts",
        "Automated deployment of hardened OS templates to bare metal, virtual machines or containers",
        "Salt-based configuration management and remote execution from the Uyuni Server",
        "Compliance auditing and tracking of hardware and software changes"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "Self-hosted Uyuni Server; managed clients register to the server as Salt minions (official install guides)"
      ],
